        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kakuliko umwi muntu wa-Saatani, izina lyakwe kali Seba mwana wa-Bikri mu-Benjamini. Oyu muntu wakali zya mweembo, wakati, Iswe tatujisi caabilo muli-Davida, tatukwe lukono mumwana wa-Jese. Kamuya nyoonse kumaanda aanu nuba-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tus 17:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo bantu boonse ba-Israyeli bakaleka kutobela Davida, bakaakutobela Seba mwana wa-Bikri, pele bantu ba-Juda bakakakatila kumwami wabo kuzwa ku-Jordano akusikila i ku-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.15.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 15:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davida wakasika kuŋanda yakwe mu-Jerusalemu. Nkabela mwami wakabweza abo banakazi abasimamambe bali ikumi mbaakasiide kulinda iŋanda, wakababika muntolongo, nkabela wakali kubalela, pele teewakala kuswanana abo pe, aboobo kabajalidwe mazuba oonse mane kusikila kukufwa kwabo, bakali kupona mbubonya mbuli bamukamufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
