              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 19:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakeza kuzoosinkilizya ku-Abeli waku-Betimaaka, nkabela bakalundika citantilo cavu anze amunzi mane cakeelana abulamfu bwabulambo, alimwi bantu boonse joabu mbaakali abo bakatalika kuuma-uma bwaanda kuti babumwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
